  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Eventually, every serious ambition becomes a question of service. What did you improve? Who became stronger because you were here? What continues working after you leave the room?",
      "start": 1.12,
      "end": 14.139,
      "wordStart": 0,
      "wordEnd": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "Legacy is not fame. Most famous people are soon forgotten. Legacy is usefulness that survives its creator. A company that treats people well. A system that saves time. Knowledge passed forward. A family made safer. A friend who took courage from your example.",
      "start": 15.5,
      "end": 33.479,
      "wordStart": 28,
      "wordEnd": 70
    },
    {
      "text": "Build things properly. Document what you learn. Teach without guarding every advantage. Leave places, systems, and people better than you found them.",
      "start": 34.319,
      "end": 43.419,
      "wordStart": 71,
      "wordEnd": 92
    },
    {
      "text": "Achievement is temporary. Character travels further.",
      "start": 44.619,
      "end": 47.799,
      "wordStart": 93,
      "wordEnd": 98
    },
    {
      "text": "You do not need to change the entire world. Improve the part that passes through your hands.",
      "start": 48.739,
      "end": 53.599,
      "wordStart": 99,
      "wordEnd": 115
    }
  ],
